      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6380436179282662226, guid: 76354cb641cf5aa46ba4902d9b7024f7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<font=\"bold\">Groningen </font>railway station is the main railway
        station in Groningen in the Province of Groningen, Netherlands. It is located
        on the Harlingen\u2013Nieuweschans railway between Zuidhorn and Groningen
        Europapark.\r\nThe first station building was completed in 1865 and demolished
        in 1894. The second and current station building was designed by Izaak Gosschalk,
        completed in 1896, and most recently restored in 2000. Train services started
        in 1866 and are currently provided by Nederlandse Spoorwegen and Arriva.
        There are 41 bus services at the station provided by Qbuzz. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
